{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"shaodi-e-o156a","title":"曹宇贺冬至称臣曹奂诏议不臣礼","accounts":[{"id":"shaodi-e-o156a-account","label":"《三少帝纪》正文","text":"曹宇贺冬至称臣曹奂诏议不臣礼","evidence":["shaodi-e-o156a-q"]},{"id":"shaodi-a-o157-judgment","label":null,"text":"有司议燕王表如旧式，诏问尊敬称王并避讳，不改公制。","evidence":["shaodi-q-o157-judgment"]}],"participants":[{"person":"mingdi-p0055","role":"上表","evidence":["shaodi-e-o156a-q"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0137","role":"诏议","evidence":["shaodi-e-o156a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":260,"label":"十一月","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"shaodi-y260","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"shaodi-q-o139","basis":"十一月"},"evidence":["shaodi-e-o156a-q","shaodi-q-o139","shaodi-q-b-77066dd061eb6a338ffa"]},"ordering_evidence":"shaodi-e-o156a-q","source_order":[4,735,"O156a"],"order":1255}],"persons":[{"id":"mingdi-p0055","name":"曹宇","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"shaodi-p0137","name":"曹奂","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"shaodi-e-o156a-q","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-16a89a67831148806499","layer":"original","quote":"十一月，燕王上表贺冬至〖1〗，称“臣”。诏曰：“古之王者，或有所不臣〖2〗；王将宜依此义。表不称‘臣’乎，又当为报〖3〗。夫后大宗者，降其私亲〖4〗，况所继者重邪〖5〗！若便同之臣妾〖6〗，亦情所未安。其皆依礼典处，当务尽其宜。”","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_001.xhtml","index":142,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":115,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-b-77066dd061eb6a338ffa","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-77066dd061eb6a338ffa","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗五年：甘露五年（公元 260 ）。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_001.xhtml","index":50,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-21e90e29c9fd438bba21","start":0,"end":20,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-o139","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-c33fc441ae4a3de17fb6","layer":"original","quote":"五年春正月朔〖1〗，日有食之。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_001.xhtml","index":45,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":15,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-o157-judgment","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-e53c9dd696d7849bbcb1","layer":"original","quote":"有司奏以为：“礼莫崇于尊祖，制莫大于正典。陛下稽德期运〖7〗，抚临万国；绍大宗之重〖8〗，隆三祖之基。伏惟燕王体尊戚属〖9〗，正位藩服〖10〗；躬秉虔肃，率蹈恭德以先万国〖11〗：其于正典，阐济大顺〖12〗，所不得制〖13〗。圣朝诚宜崇以非常之制，奉以不臣之礼。臣等平议以为〖14〗：燕王章表，可听如旧式〖15〗。中诏所施，或存好问〖16〗，准之义类，则宴觌之族也〖17〗；可少顺圣敬〖18〗，加崇仪称〖19〗，示不敢斥〖20〗，宜曰‘皇帝敬问大王侍御’。至于制书，国之正典，朝廷所以辨章公制〖21〗，宣昭轨仪于天下者也〖22〗；宜循法，故曰‘制诏燕王’。凡诏命、制书、奏事、上书诸称‘燕王’者，可皆上平〖23〗。其非宗庙助祭之事，皆不得称王名；奏事、上书、文书及吏民，皆不得触王讳：以彰殊礼加于群后〖24〗。上遵王典尊祖之制，俯顺圣敬烝烝之心〖25〗；二者不愆〖26〗，礼实宜之。可普告施行。”","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_001.xhtml","index":143,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":398,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
